{"title":"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The graph below shows the total accumulated dollars (in millions) spent by the Surf City government during <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/b/9eb87b8dcec4cffd762f5044163191496cf3cfc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1988$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />.  For example, about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fdd6d26513bbf9d11197035fe648afccd8c5d706.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$.5$\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" /> million had been spent by the beginning of February and approximately <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> million by the end of April.  Approximately how many millions of dollars were spent during the summer months of June, July, and August?\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/c/f9cddde1c49e870e60dd9a1051526987030e4fb6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(18); for (int a=1; a&lt;13; ++a)  {   draw((a,0)--(a,.5));  } for (int b=1; b&lt;6; ++b)  {   draw((-.5,2b)--(0,2b));  } draw((0,0)--(0,12)); draw((0,0)--(14,0)); draw((0,0)--(1,.9)--(2,1.9)--(3,2.6)--(4,4.3)--(5,4.5)--(6,5.7)--(7,8.2)--(8,9.4)--(9,9.8)--(10,10.1)--(11,10.2)--(12,10.5)); label(&quot;J&quot;,(.5,0),S); label(&quot;F&quot;,(1.5,0),S); label(&quot;M&quot;,(2.5,0),S); label(&quot;A&quot;,(3.5,0),S); label(&quot;M&quot;,(4.5,0),S); label(&quot;J&quot;,(5.5,0),S); label(&quot;J&quot;,(6.5,0),S); label(&quot;A&quot;,(7.5,0),S); label(&quot;S&quot;,(8.5,0),S); label(&quot;O&quot;,(9.5,0),S); label(&quot;N&quot;,(10.5,0),S); label(&quot;D&quot;,(11.5,0),S); label(&quot;month F=February&quot;,(16,0),S); label(&quot;$1$&quot;,(-.6,2),W); label(&quot;$2$&quot;,(-.6,4),W); label(&quot;$3$&quot;,(-.6,6),W); label(&quot;$4$&quot;,(-.6,8),W); label(&quot;$5$&quot;,(-.6,10),W); label(&quot;dollars in millions&quot;,(0,11.9),N); [/asy]\" width=\"645\" height=\"408\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/4/3145e3683fc229cf8e194cc6e8d87157cf7731bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 1.5 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 2.5 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 3.5 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 4.5 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 5.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"400\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/a/2aad341770e7d5d5f299e137d0154a0b6d607b93.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(18); for (int a=1; a&lt;13; ++a)  {   draw((a,0)--(a,.5));  } for (int b=1; b&lt;6; ++b)  {   draw((-.5,2b)--(0,2b));  } draw((0,0)--(0,12)); draw((0,0)--(14,0)); draw((0,0)--(1,.9)--(2,1.9)--(3,2.6)--(4,4.3)--(5,4.5)--(6,5.7)--(7,8.2)--(8,9.4)--(9,9.8)--(10,10.1)--(11,10.2)--(12,10.5)); label(&quot;J&quot;,(.5,0),S); label(&quot;F&quot;,(1.5,0),S); label(&quot;M&quot;,(2.5,0),S); label(&quot;A&quot;,(3.5,0),S); label(&quot;M&quot;,(4.5,0),S); label(&quot;J&quot;,(5.5,0),S); label(&quot;J&quot;,(6.5,0),S); label(&quot;A&quot;,(7.5,0),S); label(&quot;S&quot;,(8.5,0),S); label(&quot;O&quot;,(9.5,0),S); label(&quot;N&quot;,(10.5,0),S); label(&quot;D&quot;,(11.5,0),S); label(&quot;month F=February&quot;,(16,0),S); label(&quot;$1$&quot;,(-.6,2),W); label(&quot;$2$&quot;,(-.6,4),W); label(&quot;$3$&quot;,(-.6,6),W); label(&quot;$4$&quot;,(-.6,8),W); label(&quot;$5$&quot;,(-.6,10),W); label(&quot;dollars in millions&quot;,(0,11.9),N);  draw((5,0)--(5,4.5)--(0,4.5)); draw((8,0)--(8,9.4)--(0,9.4)); dot((8,9.4)); dot((5,4.5)); [/asy]\" width=\"645\" height=\"408\" />\n</p><p>From the graph, about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/0/110fb245ecd1d02fbfb870fdcc30f8d9241d7579.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2.2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"34\" height=\"16\" /> million was spent by the start of June and about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/3/8b332a7e0ac7528967f5a14473d322ca98d20e4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$4.7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"34\" height=\"16\" /> million was spent by the end of August.  So about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/e/61e43f86731218e46abc6658755c0f9d1ef1af6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4.7-2.2=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2.5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"163\" height=\"30\" /> million dollars were spent between these two months.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME\" title=\"1989 AJHSME\">1989 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external